      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7143218743850561371, guid: ab189d3cea7baa748aaa88219c12dd9c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: steps.Array.data[0].subtitleText
      value: On the table far ahead lies a powerful orb of teleportation.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7143218743850561371, guid: ab189d3cea7baa748aaa88219c12dd9c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: steps.Array.data[1].subtitleText
      value: To grab it you need to fire off your right arm. You can shoot it on
        a surface and control it remotely to grab the orb, or directly shoot the
        orb to automatically grab it by holding A to aim and pressing the Trigger
        to shoot.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7143218743850561371, guid: ab189d3cea7baa748aaa88219c12dd9c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: steps.Array.data[2].subtitleText
      value: Place the orb in the empty slot on your left hand.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7143218743850561371, guid: ab189d3cea7baa748aaa88219c12dd9c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: steps.Array.data[3].subtitleText
      value: Teleport to the next area behind the door by pointing your left thumbstick
        forward and letting go. The doors will open automatically when you get close
        enough.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7143218743850561371, guid: ab189d3cea7baa748aaa88219c12dd9c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: steps.Array.data[4].subtitleText
      value: Teleport in front of the next door to open it, and proceed to your next
        task.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7143218743850561371, guid: ab189d3cea7baa748aaa88219c12dd9c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: steps.Array.data[5].subtitleText
      value: Teleport all the way to the pedestal in the back of the room.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7143218743850561371, guid: ab189d3cea7baa748aaa88219c12dd9c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: steps.Array.data[6].subtitleText
      value: Detatching the orb from your left hand and placing it on the pedestal
        will start the task.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7143218743850561371, guid: ab189d3cea7baa748aaa88219c12dd9c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: steps.Array.data[7].subtitleText
      value: The task requires 3 fuses to be placed in the fusebox to function. Grab
        the missing fuse and place it in the empty slot.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7143218743850561371, guid: ab189d3cea7baa748aaa88219c12dd9c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: steps.Array.data[8].subtitleText
      value: Now grab and pull down the lever by shooting your arm on the surface
        of the wall and using the select button on your right controller when your
